arguments.prompt:
You are implementing features for a Blazor Web App shipment tracker at `/tmp/sv-f385aa52a7214aeaa089390769c6e46d/ShipmentTracker`. The project uses Interactive Auto Global mode with Individual authentication. It has two projects:
- `ShipmentTracker` (server) 
- `ShipmentTracker.Client` (WebAssembly client)

## Requirements
- Dispatchers view a list of shipments with status and destination
- Customers check their shipment status and estimated delivery
- Authentication with individual accounts (already scaffolded)

## Architecture (Auto mode)
- Interactive components MUST be in the `.Client` project
- Data access from client components must go through HTTP APIs
- Define interfaces in `.Client`, implement with HttpClient there, implement with EF Core on server
- Both Program.cs files must register matching services

## Tasks

### 1. Create shared model in Client project

Create `/tmp/sv-f385aa52a7214aeaa089390769c6e46d/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Models/Shipment.cs`:
```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

public class Shipment
{
    public int Id { get; set; }
    public string TrackingNumber { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Origin { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Destination { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public ShipmentStatus Status { get; set; }
    public DateTime ShippedDate { get; set; }
    public DateTime? EstimatedDelivery { get; set; }
    public DateTime? ActualDelivery { get; set; }
    public string CustomerEmail { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Description { get; set; } = string.Empty;
}

public enum ShipmentStatus
{
    Pending,
    PickedUp,
    InTransit,
    OutForDelivery,
    Delivered,
    Delayed
}
```

### 2. Create IShipmentService interface in Client project

Create `/tmp/sv-f385aa52a7214aeaa089390769c6e46d/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/IShipmentService.cs`:
```csharp
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

public interface IShipmentService
{
    Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync();
    Task<Shipment?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber);
    Task<List<Shipment>> GetShipmentsByCustomerAsync(string email);
    Task<Shipment> CreateShipmentAsync(Shipment shipment);
    Task<Shipment> UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus status);
}
```

### 3. Create client-side HttpClient implementation

Create `/tmp/sv-f385aa52a7214aeaa089390769c6e46d/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/ShipmentHttpService.cs`:
```csharp
using System.Net.Http.Json;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

public class ShipmentHttpService : IShipmentService
{
    private readonly HttpClient _http;

    public ShipmentHttpService(HttpClient http)
    {
        _http = http;
    }

    public async Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync()
    {
        return await _http.GetFromJsonAsync<List<Shipment>>("api/shipments") ?? [];
    }

    public async Task<Shipment?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber)
    {
        return await _http.GetFromJsonAsync<Shipment?>($"api/shipments/track/{trackingNumber}");
    }

    public async Task<List<Shipment>> GetShipmentsByCustomerAsync(string email)
    {
        return await _http.GetFromJsonAsync<List<Shipment>>($"api/shipments/customer/{Uri.EscapeDataString(email)}") ?? [];
    }

    public async Task<Shipment> CreateShipmentAsync(Shipment shipment)
    {
        var response = await _http.PostAsJsonAsync("api/shipments", shipment);
        response.EnsureSuccessStatusCode();
        return await response.Content.ReadFromJsonAsync<Shipment>() ?? shipment;
    }

    public async Task<Shipment> UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus status)
    {
        var response = await _http.PutAsJsonAsync($"api/shipments/{id}/status", status);
        response.EnsureSuccessStatusCode();
        return await response.Content.ReadFromJsonAsync<Shipment>() ?? new Shipment { Id = id, Status = status };
    }
}
```

### 4. Register HttpClient and service in Client Program.cs

Edit `/tmp/sv-f385aa52a7214aeaa089390769c6e46d/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Program.cs` to:
```csharp
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.WebAssembly.Hosting;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

var builder = WebAssemblyHostBuilder.CreateDefault(args);

builder.Services.AddAuthorizationCore();
builder.Services.AddCascadingAuthenticationState();
builder.Services.AddAuthenticationStateDeserialization();

builder.Services.AddHttpClient("ShipmentTracker.ServerAPI", client =>
    client.BaseAddress = new Uri(builder.HostEnvironment.BaseAddress));
builder.Services.AddScoped(sp =>
    sp.GetRequiredService<IHttpClientFactory>().CreateClient("ShipmentTracker.ServerAPI"));
builder.Services.AddScoped<IShipmentService, ShipmentHttpService>();

await builder.Build().RunAsync();
```

### 5. Create EF Core Shipment entity on server

Create `/tmp/sv-f385aa52a7214aeaa089390769c6e46d/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/Data/ShipmentEntity.cs`:
```csharp
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Data;

public class ShipmentEntity
{
    public int Id { get; set; }
    public string TrackingNumber { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Origin { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Destination { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public ShipmentStatus Status { get; set; }
    public DateTime ShippedDate { get; set; }
    public DateTime? EstimatedDelivery { get; set; }
    public DateTime? ActualDelivery { get; set; }
    public string CustomerEmail { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Description { get; set; } = string.Empty;
}
```

### 6. Update ApplicationDbContext to include Shipments

Edit `/tmp/sv-f385aa52a7214aeaa089390769c6e46d/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/Data/ApplicationDbContext.cs` to add a `DbSet<ShipmentEntity> Shipments` property. Read the current file and add the DbSet.

### 7. Create server-side ShipmentService

Create `/tmp/sv-f385aa52a7214aeaa089390769c6e46d/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/Services/ShipmentServerService.cs`:
```csharp
using Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;
using ShipmentTracker.Data;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Services;

public class ShipmentServerService : IShipmentService
{
    private readonly ApplicationDbContext _db;

    public ShipmentServerService(ApplicationDbContext db)
    {
        _db = db;
    }

    public async Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync()
    {
        return await _db.Shipments.Select(e => ToModel(e)).ToListAsync();
    }

    public async Task<Shipment?> GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber)
    {
        var entity = await _db.Shipments.FirstOrDefaultAsync(s => s.TrackingNumber == trackingNumber);
        return entity is null ? null : ToModel(entity);
    }

    public async Task<List<Shipment>> GetShipmentsByCustomerAsync(string email)
    {
        return await _db.Shipments
            .Where(s => s.CustomerEmail == email)
            .Select(e => ToModel(e))
            .ToListAsync();
    }

    public async Task<Shipment> CreateShipmentAsync(Shipment shipment)
    {
        var entity = new ShipmentEntity
        {
            TrackingNumber = shipment.TrackingNumber,
            Origin = shipment.Origin,
            Destination = shipment.Destination,
            Status = shipment.Status,
            ShippedDate = shipment.ShippedDate,
            EstimatedDelivery = shipment.EstimatedDelivery,
            CustomerEmail = shipment.CustomerEmail,
            Description = shipment.Description
        };
        _db.Shipments.Add(entity);
        await _db.SaveChangesAsync();
        return ToModel(entity);
    }

    public async Task<Shipment> UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus status)
    {
        var entity = await _db.Shipments.FindAsync(id)
            ?? throw new InvalidOperationException($"Shipment {id} not found.");
        entity.Status = status;
        if (status == ShipmentStatus.Delivered)
            entity.ActualDelivery = DateTime.UtcNow;
        await _db.SaveChangesAsync();
        return ToModel(entity);
    }

    private static Shipment ToModel(ShipmentEntity e) => new()
    {
        Id = e.Id,
        TrackingNumber = e.TrackingNumber,
        Origin = e.Origin,
        Destination = e.Destination,
        Status = e.Status,
        ShippedDate = e.ShippedDate,
        EstimatedDelivery = e.EstimatedDelivery,
        ActualDelivery = e.ActualDelivery,
        CustomerEmail = e.CustomerEmail,
        Description = e.Description
    };
}
```

### 8. Create API endpoints and register server service

Edit `/tmp/sv-f385aa52a7214aeaa089390769c6e46d/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/Program.cs`. Add BEFORE `app.Run();`:

```csharp
// Register server-side shipment service
```

Actually, do this properly. Add to the service registration section (after the Identity setup):
```csharp
builder.Services.AddScoped<IShipmentService, ShipmentServerService>();
```

And add the API endpoints before `app.Run()`:
```csharp
// Shipment API endpoints
var shipments = app.MapGroup("api/shipments").RequireAuthorization();

shipments.MapGet("", async (IShipmentService service) =>
    Results.Ok(await service.GetAllShipmentsAsync()));

shipments.MapGet("track/{trackingNumber}", async (string trackingNumber, IShipmentService service) =>
{
    var shipment = await service.GetShipmentByTrackingNumberAsync(trackingNumber);
    return shipment is null ? Results.NotFound() : Results.Ok(shipment);
});

shipments.MapGet("customer/{email}", async (string email, IShipmentService service) =>
    Results.Ok(await service.GetShipmentsByCustomerAsync(email)));

shipments.MapPost("", async (Shipment shipment, IShipmentService service) =>
{
    var created = await service.CreateShipmentAsync(shipment);
    return Results.Created($"api/shipments/track/{created.TrackingNumber}", created);
});

shipments.MapPut("{id}/status", async (int id, ShipmentStatus status, IShipmentService service) =>
{
    var updated = await service.UpdateShipmentStatusAsync(id, status);
    return Results.Ok(updated);
});
