### 11. Create ProgressTracker component

Create `/tmp/sv-f385aa52a7214aeaa089390769c6e46d/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Components/ProgressTracker.razor`:
```razor
@using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models

<div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
    @foreach (var step in steps)
    {
        <div class="text-center flex-fill">
            <div class="rounded-circle mx-auto d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center @(IsReached(step) ? "bg-success text-white" : "bg-light text-muted")"
                 style="width: 36px; height: 36px; font-size: 0.8rem;">
                @(IsReached(step) ? "✓" : "○")
            </div>
            <small class="d-block mt-1 @(IsReached(step) ? "fw-bold" : "text-muted")">@step</small>
        </div>
    }
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter]
    public ShipmentStatus Status { get; set; }

    private static readonly ShipmentStatus[] steps =
    [
        ShipmentStatus.Pending,
        ShipmentStatus.PickedUp,
        ShipmentStatus.InTransit,
        ShipmentStatus.OutForDelivery,
        ShipmentStatus.Delivered
    ];

    private bool IsReached(ShipmentStatus step) => Status >= step && Status != ShipmentStatus.Delayed;
}
```

